{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmarise is a challenging climbing game mixed with psychological horror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you go to sleep, the nightmare begins. The ultimate goal is simple - you have to wake up. To do that, you'll need to climb and reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way up through strange structures that don\u2019t belong in the real world. Every jump matters. Every mistake sends you down again. Compete for time, help each other through the nightmare, or just try to reach the top before it consumes what\u2019s left of your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/2689a29bdbe49a8b755000f003fc34a5.poster.avif?t=1765289783\" width=1000 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/2689a29bdbe49a8b755000f003fc34a5.webm?t=1765289783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/2689a29bdbe49a8b755000f003fc34a5.mp4?t=1765289783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Between climbs, everything slows down. The game changes perspective, pulling you through darker sections built on tension and raw fear. Survive them to return to the climb and push higher into the dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/dd6a1dbf80c6c7db6212eaf0ac04903a.poster.avif?t=1765289783\" width=1000 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/dd6a1dbf80c6c7db6212eaf0ac04903a.webm?t=1765289783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/dd6a1dbf80c6c7db6212eaf0ac04903a.mp4?t=1765289783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play solo for a tense, isolated experience, or join up to three friends in a shared nightmare. Coordinate each climb, watch each other fall, and try to keep it together as the dream twists around all of you. Whether you help or compete, only one goal matters - reach the top, alone or together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/813d7834f5a543ce253e8bd06149f593.poster.avif?t=1765289783\" width=1000 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/813d7834f5a543ce253e8bd06149f593.webm?t=1765289783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/813d7834f5a543ce253e8bd06149f593.mp4?t=1765289783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The nightmare doesn\u2019t wait. Every second counts as you climb higher, trying to escape as fast as possible. Challenge yourself or your team to escape the nightmare faster with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/dc83585f6e8e082d493cb3591f9923d6.poster.avif?t=1765289783\" width=1000 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/dc83585f6e8e082d493cb3591f9923d6.webm?t=1765289783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/dc83585f6e8e082d493cb3591f9923d6.mp4?t=1765289783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/09106a9faef51354655a0f0f8bf66500.webp?t=1765289783\" width=40 height=40 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fast third-person climbing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/09106a9faef51354655a0f0f8bf66500.webp?t=1765289783\" width=40 height=40 /></span><strong>\u00a0</strong><br><strong>Slow first-person horror gameplay parts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/09106a9faef51354655a0f0f8bf66500.webp?t=1765289783\" width=40 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Single-player and up to 4 player multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/09106a9faef51354655a0f0f8bf66500.webp?t=1765289783\" width=40 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-a