ent, self-harm, or drug use. Player discretion is advised."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmarise is a challenging climbing game mixed with psychological horror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you go to sleep, the nightmare begins. The ultimate goal is simple - you have to wake up. To do that, you'll need to climb and reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way up through strange structures that don\u2019t belong in the real world. Every jump matters. Every mistake sends you down again. Compete for time, help each other through the nightmare, or just try to reach the top before it consumes what\u2019s left of your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/2689a29bdbe49a8b755000f003fc34a5.poster.avif?t=1765289783\" width=1000 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/2689a29bdbe49a8b755000f003fc34a5.webm?t=1765289783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123860/extras/2689a29bdbe49a8b755000f003fc34a5.mp4?t=1765289783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Between climbs, everything slows down. The game changes perspective, pulling you through darker sections built on tension and raw fear. Survive them to return to the climb and push higher into the dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c